  "lm:shiprock": { title:"Shiprock", extract:"A volcanic neck on the Navajo Nation in northwest New Mexico, rising about 1,500 feet from the plain. In Din\u00e9 it is Ts\u00e9 Bit\u02bca\u02bc\u00ed, the winged rock." },
